    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_4888",
      "reading_order": 6785,
      "severity": "caution",
      "content": "CAUTION: Some parts are sensitive to electrostatic discharge (ESD). Always perform service",
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 657.405,
        "r": 181.75,
        "b": 645.815
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_1853",
      "reading_order": 6787,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 191.02485044024135,
        "t": 661.1450653076172,
        "r": 210.53762207555454,
        "b": 640.2856292724609
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_1853.png",
      "width": 19,
      "height": 20,
      "image_hash": "52b973d481d6c454892e404b71ff0705301fcfe8edda6f2bf4c5964135f7cb25",
      "next_block_id": "txt_4890"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_4890",
      "reading_order": 6788,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 638.79,
        "r": 549.7700400000001,
        "b": 603.2
      },
      "content": "work at an ESD-protected workstation or mat. If an ESD workstation or mat is not available, touch the sheet-metal chassis to provide a static ground before touching an ESD-sensitive assembly. Protect the ESD-sensitive assemblies by placing them in ESD pouches when they are out of the printer."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_4891",
      "reading_order": 6789,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00004,
        "t": 593.79,
        "r": 548.6300400000002,
        "b": 558.2
      },
      "content": "If the replacement part is a roller or pad, avoid touching the spongy part of it. Skin oils on the roller or pad can cause paper pickup and/or print-quality problems. HP recommends using disposable gloves when handling rollers or pads or washing your hands before touching rollers or pads."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4892",
      "reading_order": 6790,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 548.79,
        "r": 541.73,
        "b": 525.2
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Make sure that all of the shipping materials (for example shipping tape) are removed from the replacement part prior to installation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4893",
      "reading_order": 6791,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 122.0,
        "t": 514.29,
        "r": 343.02,
        "b": 502.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "To install an assembly, reverse the removal steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_4894",
      "reading_order": 6792,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00002,
        "t": 493.28999999999996,
        "r": 551.6100400000003,
        "b": 457.7
      },
      "content": "When applicable, special installation instructions are provided for an assembly at the end of the removal procedure. Always completely read the removal instructions and follow all special installation instructions."
    },
